<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read this&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; PR 1 and PR 2 start together.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; PR 3 and PR 4 run side by side once PR 1 is merged.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; PR 5 is the join point: it needs PR 1, 2, 3 and 4. PR 6 adds the overview links once the page exists.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Longest chain: PR 1 &amp;rarr; 3 &amp;rarr; 5 &amp;rarr; 6 &amp;rarr; 7 (5 PRs in sequence)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CCCCCC;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="430" width="780" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>